  "changelog": "GrayMatter 0.2.0 introduces a comprehensive OpenClaw skill for durable memory, live schema awareness, and object-graph state within authenticated organizational context.\n\n- Provides primary durable memory via api-0, superseding file-based storage except for fallback.\n- Enables access to live object-graph and organizational schema, with robust agent registration and OpenAPI sync as part of activation.\n- Includes scripts for authentication, operational checks, memory/graph/entity operations, and environment management.\n- Emphasizes safe, RBAC-scoped, and persistent memory and coordination for OpenClaw instances.\n- Outlines clear user flows for install, activation, login, and memory/query operations.",
